  "details": "Big issue that has been bugging me for a while. When VRC starts it takes control of everything midi on my computer. If I leave my DAW open with everything setup before I load VRC I can still use my software synths and play live for my friends, but if I bump a cable VRC takes control from my DAW. takes a good 10 minutes to restart everything in order again.\nI can't find anyway to disable VRC from taking control of my midi devices. A simple disable midi input option in settings would be amazing.",
